<title>UK: Torday gains after upbeat press comment.</title>
<headline>Torday gains after upbeat press comment.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in engineering grup Torday &amp; Carlisle Plc rose on Monday after upbeat comment on the stock in the Mail on Sunday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The stock was up 9p at 55-1/2 by 0940 GMT.</p>
<p>The Mail report highlighted recent share purchases by Torday directors and said the company was heading for recovery after several years of losses.</p>
<p>It said the stock had yet to reflect the company's recovery potential and noted that one fund manager had been adding to its holdings.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
